{"unit":93,"section":4,"cefr":"A2","objective":"discuss health and medical situations","skill":"Health","heading":"Health vocabulary","phrases":[{"he":"אני צריך ללכת לרופא.","en":"I need to go to the doctor.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I"]},{"w":"צריך","h":["need","have to"]},{"w":"ללכת","h":["to go"]},{"w":"לרופא","h":["to the doctor"]}]},{"he":"יש לי כאב ראש נורא.","en":"I have a terrible headache.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"יש","h":["there is","have"]},{"w":"לי","h":["to me","I have"]},{"w":"כאב","h":["pain","ache"]},{"w":"ראש","h":["head"]},{"w":"נורא","h":["terrible","awful"]}]},{"he":"הרופא נתן לי מרשם לתרופה.","en":"The doctor gave me a prescription for medicine.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הרופא","h":["the doctor"]},{"w":"נתן","h":["gave"]},{"w":"לי","h":["to me","me"]},{"w":"מרשם","h":["prescription"]},{"w":"לתרופה","h":["for medicine"]}]},{"he":"היא חולה ונשארת בבית.","en":"She is sick and staying home.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"היא","h":["she"]},{"w":"חולה","h":["sick","ill"]},{"w":"ונשארת","h":["and staying"]},{"w":"בבית","h":["at home","in the house"]}]},{"he":"הבדיקה במרפאה בשעה עשר.","en":"The checkup at the clinic is at ten o'clock.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הבדיקה","h":["the checkup","the test"]},{"w":"במרפאה","h":["at the clinic"]},{"w":"בשעה","h":["at (time)"]},{"w":"עשר","h":["ten"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"אני חולה.","en":"I am sick.","alt":["I am ill."],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש לי חום.","en":"I have a fever.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא רופא טוב.","en":"He is a good doctor.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"איפה המרפאה?","en":"Where is the clinic?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש לי כאב.","en":"I have pain.","alt":["I am in pain."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני צריך תרופה.","en":"I need medicine.","alt":["I need medication."],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא לא חולה.","en":"She is not sick.","alt":["She isn't ill."],"t":"t"},{"he":"מתי הבדיקה שלך?","en":"When is your checkup?","alt":["When is your test?"],"t":"l"},{"he":"הרופא בבית חולים.","en":"The doctor is at the hospital.","alt":["The doctor is in the hospital."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הרוקח נתן לי תרופה.","en":"The pharmacist gave me medicine.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה צריך ללכת לרופא.","en":"You need to go to the doctor.","alt":["You should go to the doctor."],"t":"l"},{"he":"יש לה כאב ראש.","en":"She has a headache.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילד חולה היום.","en":"The child is sick today.","alt":["The kid is ill today."],"t":"t"},{"he":"למה אתה לא לוקח תרופה?","en":"Why aren't you taking medicine?","alt":["Why don't you take medicine?"],"t":"l"},{"he":"אין לי חום, אני בסדר.","en":"I don't have a fever, I'm fine.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הרופאה אמרה לנוח.","en":"The doctor said to rest.","alt":["The doctor told me to rest."],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש מרפאה ליד הבית שלנו.","en":"There is a clinic near our house.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הבדיקה הייתה קלה.","en":"The checkup was easy.","alt":["The test was easy."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא אוהב ללכת לרופא.","en":"I don't like going to the doctor.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא לקח את התרופה בבוקר.","en":"He took the medicine in the morning.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הרוקח אמר לקחת שתי כדורים.","en":"The pharmacist said to take two pills.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כמה עולה הביקור אצל הרופא?","en":"How much does the doctor's visit cost?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הילדה חולה, אז היא בבית.","en":"The girl is sick, so she is at home.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני צריכה מרשם לתרופה הזאת.","en":"I need a prescription for this medicine.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יש לו כאב בטן כבר יומיים.","en":"He has had a stomachache for two days.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המרפאה פתוחה עד שעה חמש.","en":"The clinic is open until five o'clock.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"בית החולים הזה גדול מאוד.","en":"This hospital is very big.","alt":["This hospital is very large."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הרופא אמר שאני צריך בדיקה.","en":"The doctor said I need a checkup.","alt":["The doctor said I need a test."],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא עובדת כרופאה בבית חולים.","en":"She works as a doctor at a hospital.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"התרופה הזאת עוזרת לכאב ראש.","en":"This medicine helps with headaches.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אל תשכח לקחת את התרופה שלך.","en":"Don't forget to take your medicine.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הרוקחת שאלה אם יש לי מרשם.","en":"The pharmacist asked if I have a prescription.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"החום ירד אחרי שלקחתי תרופה.","en":"The fever went down after I took medicine.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו הולכים למרפאה מחר בבוקר.","en":"We are going to the clinic tomorrow morning.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הרופא שלי אומר שאני צריך לנוח יותר.","en":"My doctor says I need to rest more.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אם יש לך חום, אתה צריך להישאר בבית.","en":"If you have a fever, you need to stay home.","alt":["If you have a fever, you should stay home."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבדיקה בבית החולים לקחה שעתיים.","en":"The test at the hospital took two hours.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הרופא כתב לי מרשם והלכתי לרוקח.","en":"The doctor wrote me a prescription and I went to the pharmacist.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכאב לא עובר, אני צריכה ללכת לרופא.","en":"The pain isn't going away, I need to go to the doctor.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"בבית חולים אפשר לקבל עזרה בכל שעה.","en":"At a hospital you can get help at any hour.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"אני":"I / I am","חולה":"sick / ill","יש":"there is / have / has","לי":"to me / I have / me","חום":"fever / heat","הוא":"he / he is","רופא":"doctor","טוב":"good","איפה":"where","המרפאה":"the clinic","כאב":"pain / ache","צריך":"need / have to","תרופה":"medicine / medication","היא":"she / she is","לא":"not / don't / isn't","מתי":"when","הבדיקה":"the checkup / the test","שלך":"your / yours","הרופא":"the doctor","בבית":"at home / in the house","חולים":"hospital (in beit kholim)","הרוקח":"the pharmacist","נתן":"gave","אתה":"you (m.)","ללכת":"to go","לרופא":"to the doctor","לה":"she has / to her","ראש":"head","הילד":"the child / the kid","היום":"today","למה":"why","לוקח":"taking / takes","אין":"don't have / there isn't","בסדר":"fine / okay","הרופאה":"the doctor (f.)","אמרה":"said (f.)","לנוח":"to rest","ליד":"near / next to","הבית":"the house / the home","שלנו":"our / ours","הייתה":"was (f.)","קלה":"easy (f.)","אוהב":"like / love (m.)","לקח":"took","את":"the (object marker)","התרופה":"the medicine","בבוקר":"in the morning","הרוקחת":"the pharmacist (f.)","שאלה":"asked (f.)","אם":"if / whether","מרשם":"prescription","כמה":"how much / how many","עולה":"costs","הביקור":"the visit","אצל":"at (someone's place)","הילדה":"the girl","אז":"so / then","צריכה":"need (f.)","הזאת":"this (f.)","לו":"he has / to him","בטן":"stomach","כבר":"already","יומיים":"two days","פתוחה":"open (f.)","עד":"until","שעה":"hour / o'clock","חמש":"five","בית":"house","החולים":"the sick / hospital (in beit kholim)","הזה":"this (m.)","גדול":"big / large","מאוד":"very","שאני":"that I","בדיקה":"checkup / test","עובדת":"works (f.)","כרופאה":"as a doctor (f.)","עוזרת":"helps (f.)","לכאב":"for pain","אל":"don't (negative imperative)","תשכח":"forget","שלי":"my / mine","ירד":"went down","אחרי":"after","שלקחתי":"that I took","אנחנו":"we","הולכים":"going","מחר":"tomorrow","אומר":"says","יותר":"more","להישאר":"to stay","לקחה":"took (f.)","שעתיים":"two hours","כתב":"wrote","והלכתי":"and I went","לרוקח":"to the pharmacist","הכאב":"the pain","עובר":"passes / goes away","לקבל":"to get / to receive","עזרה":"help","כל":"every / all","במרפאה":"at the clinic","מרפאה":"clinic","בית חולים":"hospital","רופאה":"doctor (f.)","רוקח":"pharmacist","כדורים":"pills","לך":"you have / to you","אמר":"said (m.)","לקחת":"to take","שתי":"two (f.)"},"words":[{"he":"רופא","en":"doctor","alt":["physician"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"rofe"},{"he":"תרופה","en":"medicine","alt":["medication"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"trufah"},{"he":"כאב","en":"pain","alt":["ache"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ke'ev"},{"he":"חום","en":"fever","alt":["heat"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"khom"},{"he":"בדיקה","en":"checkup","alt":["test","examination"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"bedikah"},{"he":"מרפאה","en":"clinic","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"mirpa'ah"},{"he":"חולה","en":"sick","alt":["ill"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"kholeh"},{"he":"בית חולים","en":"hospital","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"beit kholim"},{"he":"מרשם","en":"prescription","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"mirsham"},{"he":"רוקח","en":"pharmacist","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"rokea'kh"},{"he":"רופאה","en":"doctor (f.)","alt":["physician (f.)"],"from":"skill","tr":"rofah"},{"he":"הרוקחת","en":"the pharmacist (f.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"harokakhat"},{"he":"כאב ראש","en":"headache","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ke'ev rosh"},{"he":"כאב בטן","en":"stomachache","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ke'ev beten"},{"he":"לנוח","en":"to rest","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"lanu'akh"},{"he":"ללכת","en":"to go","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"lalekhet"},{"he":"נתן","en":"gave","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"natan"},{"he":"ונשארת","en":"and staying","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"venish'eret"},{"he":"לתרופה","en":"for medicine","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"latrufah"},{"he":"נורא","en":"terrible","alt":["awful"],"from":"phrase","tr":"nora"}],"lexemes":["רופא","רופאה","תרופה","כאב","חום","בדיקה","מרפאה","חולה","בית חולים","מרשם","רוקח","רוקחת","כאב ראש","כאב בטן","לנוח","הבדיקה","התרופה","המרפאה","הרופא","הרופאה","הרוקח","הרוקחת"],"tips":"## Medical Vocabulary\n\nIsrael has excellent healthcare. Here are key terms for visiting a doctor:\n\n| Hebrew | Transliteration | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| רופא / רופאה | rofe / rofah | doctor (m/f) |\n| תרופה | trufah | medicine |\n| מרשם | mirsham | prescription |\n| בדיקה | bedikah | checkup/test |\n| מרפאה | mirpa'ah | clinic |\n| בית חולים | beit kholim | hospital |\n| רוקח / רוקחת | rokea'kh / rokakhat | pharmacist (m/f) |\n\n### Useful Phrases\n- **יש לי כאב ב...** — I have a pain in...\n- **אני צריך/ה ללכת לרופא** — I need to go to the doctor\n- **כאב ראש** — headache (literally: head pain)\n- **כאב בטן** — stomachache (literally: stomach pain)\n\nNote: **חולה** (kholeh) is the same form for both masculine and feminine: הוא חולה / היא חולה."}
